- **Empathy turn** — the lip-syncing. Dancing is older than singing for her and is the one reliable technology she has for being okay in her body. When they compete for four minutes of stage time she picks the older one. That doesn't refund a ticket; it names the trade.
- **Critic pressure conceded** — she engineered a show designed to be watched, then wrote "purple lace bra" about the pain of being watched instead of heard.
